    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503130/extras/3529d973e5f6f45bc83fb45504a5411b.avif?t=1709979624\" /></span><br><br>Welcome to Only Fortress, the ultimate fortress-building experience where you are the hero! Dive into a world of strategic PvP and PvM challenges, where your skills and tactical prowess shape your destiny. Customize every aspect of your fortress, from the grounds to the walls, and construct buildings instantly without the hassle of waiting. Embark on epic explorations with your troops, mastering powerful spells and engaging in cross-platform battles with players from all around the world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503130/extras/92ac5abbdb9324374a0c8642c6f92a8c.poster.avif?t=1709979624\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503130/extras/92ac5abbdb9324374a0c8642c6f92a8c.webm?t=1709979624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503130/extras/92ac5abbdb9324374a0c8642c6f92a8c.mp4?t=1709979624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Unleash your creativity and design a fortress that reflects your style and strategic vision. No detail is too small in your quest for dominance.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503130/extras/41812c8b7c07aa6223e99ea95a930737.poster.avif?t=1709979624\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503130/extras/41812c8b7c07aa6223e99ea95a930737.webm?t=1709979624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503130/extras/41812c8b7c07aa6223e99ea95a930737.mp4?t=1709979624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Take control of your hero, a formidable force in combat, alongside a carefully chosen team of special hero-troops. Engage in intense battles, leveraging your character's unique abilities and unleashing devastating spells. Your hero is the key to victory!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503130/extras/3529d973e5f6f45bc83fb45504a5411b.avif?t=1709979624\" /></span><br><br>Welcome to Only Fortress, the ultimate fortress-building experience where you are the hero! Dive into a world of strategic PvP and PvM challenges, where your skills and tactical prowess shape your destiny. Customize every aspect of your fortress, from the grounds to the walls, and construct buildings instantly without the hassle of waiting. Embark on epic explorations with your troops, mastering powerful spells and engaging in cross-platform battles with players from all around the world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503130/extras/92ac5abbdb9324374a0c8642c6f92a8c.poster.avif?t=1709979624\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503130/extras/92ac5abbdb9324374a0c8642c6f92a8c.webm?t=1709979624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503130/extras/92ac5abbdb9324374a0c8642c6f92a8c.mp4?t=1709979624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Unleash your creativity and design a fortress that reflects your style and strategic vision. No detail is too small in your quest for dominance.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503130/extras/41812c8b7c07aa6223e99ea95a930737.poster.avif?t=1709979624\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503130/extras/41812c8b7c07aa6223e99ea95a930737.webm?t=1709979624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503130/extras/41812c8b7c07aa6223e99ea95a930737.mp4?t=1709979624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Take control of your hero, a formidable force in combat, alongside a carefully chosen team of special hero-troops. Engage in intense battles, leveraging your character's unique abilities and unleashing devastating spells. Your hero is the key to victory!",
